    "widget": {
     "title": "Radius · Live Operations",
     "text": {
      "format": "MARKDOWN",
      "content": "**Every layer of the live architecture on one screen.** Top: health right now and the last 24 h. Then the SLOs and their error budgets, then one row per Google Cloud service (Cloud Run, Firestore, Pub/Sub, Vertex AI / Gemini, Cloud Scheduler), live logs and open incidents. Alerts email the team. Project `nearby-events-510418`, Cloud Run `nearby-events`, asia-south1."
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "xPos": 0,
    "yPos": 2,
    "width": 2,
    "height": 3,
    "widget": {
     "title": "Uptime checks passing (1 = 100%)",
